{"version":1,"content":"<p>科學家首次成功演示了一種由激光生成等離子體光束構成的無線電天線。這種裝置不需要傳統天線常見的金屬杆或機械伸縮結構，而是利用激光將空氣電離，形成一條細長的等離子體通道，再通過電磁場向其饋入無線電信號，使其能夠發射無線電波。研究人員表示，這項技術未來有望用於衞星通信、雷達系統以及太空探索設備。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1583444.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T22:39:59.899284+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T22:18:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T22:38:04.525278+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T22:38:04.525278+00:00","content_hash":"2bb8c19021d5beb115133d5e29e39f1224233963c6914e19d0188f238d68a068","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}